# p06 contradiction variant (INTENTIONALLY INCONSISTENT with base.ttl + p06_not_applicable.ttl)
#
# LinkML option: none.
#
# Asserts a length measurement assay as part of the hair lock relic examination. With
# 'part of' inverseOf 'has part' (base.ttl), the reasoner derives that relicExam1 has a length
# measurement assay part, violating the cardinality-0 restriction.
# Load together with base.ttl and p06_not_applicable.ttl.

@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
